Really, like talking to people has so

00:28:45.240 --> 00:28:48.800
many benefits, because that's really how

00:28:47.040 --> 00:28:50.600
you learn like life lessons. And

00:28:48.800 --> 00:28:52.160
eventually, if you can absorb those

00:28:50.600 --> 00:28:53.840
lessons and learn from that, the

00:28:52.160 --> 00:28:56.320
softness that you get to experience in

00:28:53.840 --> 00:28:59.320
your life, all of that can be real. When

00:28:56.320 --> 00:29:01.320
you actually rest, it's a real gift and

00:28:59.320 --> 00:29:02.840
not part of like, you know, something

00:29:01.320 --> 00:29:05.040
that's already given to you because you

00:29:02.840 --> 00:29:06.600
will absolutely take all of that for

00:29:05.040 --> 00:29:08.000
granted. And then when you take

00:29:06.600 --> 00:29:10.200
everything for granted and you have no

00:29:08.000 --> 00:29:11.320
purpose, that's when you get depressed.

00:29:10.200 --> 00:29:12.760
I'm not saying that's the only thing

00:29:11.320 --> 00:29:13.760
because I've been chronically depressed,

00:29:12.760 --> 00:29:16.120
but you know, that's kind of where your

00:29:13.760 --> 00:29:18.320
headspace goes to. But softness is not a

00:29:16.120 --> 00:29:20.880
given. It is not owed to you. And when

00:29:18.320 --> 00:29:23.000
you stay in any of your given lives, it

00:29:20.880 --> 00:29:25.240
has to be this active choice that you

00:29:23.000 --> 00:29:27.600
continue to make over and over again.

00:29:25.240 --> 00:29:30.080
And it's not like a life sentence. You

00:29:27.600 --> 00:29:32.480
deserve to have more and so want more

00:29:30.080 --> 00:29:35.040
for yourself. You deserve to have more

00:29:32.480 --> 00:29:38.040
ambition. You deserve to be independent

00:29:35.040 --> 00:29:40.400
from others, dependent only on yourself,

00:29:38.040 --> 00:29:42.320
and interdependent on your community, on

00:29:40.400 --> 00:29:44.960
the people that you love and who will

00:29:42.320 --> 00:29:46.880
give back to you and you give freely to.

00:29:44.960 --> 00:29:48.480
That's beautiful, isn't it? And remember

00:29:46.880 --> 00:29:50.840
your purpose to life and that's my

00:29:48.480 --> 00:29:52.840
